commitResults.messageBody:
- ci.yml: activated on pull_request + push (was workflow_dispatch only);
  added concurrency group to prevent double-fire on PR branch commits
- cd.yml: tag-triggered (v*.*.*); switched registry GHCR → Docker Hub;
  corrected VPS path to /var/www/yorindo; health check → demo.dhanifudin.com;
  added tag guard to fail fast on manual dispatch without a tag ref
- deploy.yml: tag-triggered alongside cd.yml for unified release moment
- docker-compose.yml: removed postgres/redis (in-memory Phase 1 demo);
  image refs → dhanifudin/yorindo-*:latest; added REPOSITORY_MODE=memory
- nginx/nginx.conf: single-domain demo.dhanifudin.com with /api/ routing
- docs/secrets-setup.md: updated secrets (GHCR → Docker Hub), VPS path,
  branch protection setup, and release tag instructions

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
